   "finding": "F2; R42",
   "why": "A new load starts with the repetitions its gate allows: ADVANCE the logged repetitions, HOLD and REGRESS the row's target, so HOLD repeats the dose it held. The credit restarts at 0 whoever set the higher load (R42)",
